{"91:1:1":"By the sun","91:1:2":"and its brightness","91:2:1":"And the moon","91:2:2":"when","91:2:3":"it follows it","91:3:1":"And the day","91:3:2":"when","91:3:3":"it displays it","91:4:1":"And the night","91:4:2":"when","91:4:3":"it covers it","91:5:1":"And the heaven","91:5:2":"and (He) Who","91:5:3":"constructed it","91:6:1":"And the earth","91:6:2":"and by (He) Who","91:6:3":"spread it","91:7:1":"And (the) soul","91:7:2":"and (He) Who","91:7:3":"proportioned it","91:8:1":"And He inspired it","91:8:2":"(to distinguish) its wickedness","91:8:3":"and its righteousness","91:9:1":"Indeed","91:9:2":"he succeeds","91:9:3":"who","91:9:4":"purifies it","91:10:1":"And indeed","91:10:2":"he fails","91:10:3":"who","91:10:4":"buries it","91:11:1":"Denied","91:11:2":"Thamud","91:11:3":"by their transgression","91:12:1":"When","91:12:2":"(was) sent forth","91:12:3":"(the) most wicked of them","91:13:1":"But said","91:13:2":"to them","91:13:3":"(the) Messenger","91:13:4":"(of) Allah","91:13:5":"(It is the) she-camel","91:13:6":"(of) Allah","91:13:7":"and her drink","91:14:1":"But they denied him","91:14:2":"and they hamstrung her","91:14:3":"So destroyed","91:14:4":"them","91:14:5":"their Lord","91:14:6":"for their sin","91:14:7":"and leveled them","91:15:1":"And not","91:15:2":"He fears","91:15:3":"its consequences","92:1:1":"By the night","92:1:2":"when","92:1:3":"it covers","92:2:1":"And the day","92:2:2":"when","92:2:3":"it shines in brightness","92:3:1":"And He Who","92:3:2":"created","92:3:3":"the male","92:3:4":"and the female","92:4:1":"Indeed","92:4:2":"your efforts","92:4:3":"(are) surely diverse","92:5:1":"Then as for","92:5:2":"(him) who","92:5:3":"gives","92:5:4":"and fears","92:6:1":"And believes","92:6:2":"in the best","92:7:1":"Then We will ease him","92:7:2":"towards [the] ease","92:8:1":"But as for","92:8:2":"(him) who","92:8:3":"withholds","92:8:4":"and considers himself free from need","92:9:1":"And denies","92:9:2":"the best","92:10:1":"Then We will ease him","92:10:2":"towards [the] difficulty","92:11:1":"And not","92:11:2":"will avail","92:11:3":"him","92:11:4":"his wealth","92:11:5":"when","92:11:6":"he falls","92:12:1":"Indeed","92:12:2":"upon Us","92:12:3":"(is) the guidance","92:13:1":"And indeed","92:13:2":"for Us","92:13:3":"(is) the Hereafter","92:13:4":"and the first (life)","92:14:1":"So I warn you","92:14:2":"(of) a Fire","92:14:3":"blazing"}